 "summary": "A single NPN bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-89-3L plastic package. It holds off 30 V collector to emitter, carries 3 A continuous collector current and may dissipate 0.5 W at 25 °C ambient. Parts are graded into four DC gain ranks, R, O, Y and GR, by hFE at 2 V and 1 A; the 160-320 range is rank Y.",
